# MODULE sixteen bit decision and executable arithmetic guest cell step
# PURPOSE preserve indexed PC and fuel decisions and compute the resulting guest cell
# INPUT one byte query count and eight bytes per decision record
# INPUT opcode two byte PC two byte bracket target one cell byte two byte fuel
# OUTPUT six bytes per record status next PC two bytes fuel two bytes new cell value
# TAPE status and position remain in the existing decision cells
# TAPE temporary cells twelve through eighteen hold arithmetic predicate flags
# LIMITATION caller supplies verified opcode matching bracket and exact physical stream
# LIMITATION this slice does not execute guest input output or keep state across records
# LIMITATION untrusted source closure remains unsupported

